{"title":"스피카","artist":"로쿠데나시","sourceId":"reference:0tWWBwchd4zgYFD7XQb5","sourceHash":"19d095f5e42de15e3b3358f74554eb3d9ddd2144986321be9859e7c2dcaaf3c7","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":17249873,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":21.25,"end":24.88,"text":"まだらな日々に 夜は長く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":24.88,"end":28.29,"text":"エコーは仄か 声を探すの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":28.29,"end":31.85,"text":"こんな夜空に まだひとつだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":31.85,"end":35.24,"text":"灯りがあるようだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":35.24,"end":38.54,"text":"欲しい未来は そんなに無くて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":38.54,"end":42.14,"text":"君がいるなら それくらいだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":42.14,"end":45.54,"text":"その次くらいに 僕がいれたら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":45.54,"end":48.58,"text":"それでいいのにな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":48.58,"end":52.24,"text":"「会いたい」の改行と定型","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":52.24,"end":55.61,"text":"いたいの いたいの とんでいけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":55.61,"end":58.77,"text":"この感情は君がくれたの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":58.77,"end":62.42,"text":"その瞬間を愛と名付けた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":62.42,"end":65.82,"text":"届かぬスピカ 変われぬ僕が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":65.82,"end":70.39,"text":"ずっと ずっと 手を伸ばしてた 嗚呼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":83.74,"end":87.06,"text":"願い事が増えるたびに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":87.06,"end":90.57,"text":"ぼやける朝 星を集めた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":90.57,"end":94.19,"text":"近づくほど 辛くなるなんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":94.19,"end":97.78,"text":"どうかしてる あぁ、どうかしてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":97.78,"end":100.72,"text":"君は僕に咲いた一等星","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":100.72,"end":104.42,"text":"眩しいからこんな心は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":104.42,"end":107.68,"text":"どこかへ捨ててしまおうか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":107.68,"end":111.58,"text":"なんてこれも馬鹿な空想だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":111.58,"end":114.7,"text":"愛の体温と酩酊","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":114.7,"end":118.0,"text":"「痛い」と 「居たい」を ループして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":118.0,"end":121.36,"text":"この感情は君がくれたの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":121.36,"end":125.13,"text":"その瞬間を愛と名付けた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":125.13,"end":128.47,"text":"惑える星を 迷える僕を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":128.47,"end":132.02,"text":"そっと そっと 照らしてくれた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":132.02,"end":135.35,"text":"この永遠を君にあげよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":135.35,"end":138.95,"text":"その瞬間は僕でいられる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":138.95,"end":142.38,"text":"彼方のスピカ 変わらず星が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":142.38,"end":149.77,"text":"今日も 明日も 輝いている 嗚呼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":149.77,"end":151.56,"text":"嗚呼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}